                },
                {
                  "id": "h-choosing-mechanic",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing the Right Diesel Mechanic for Semi Trucks",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "choosing-mechanic"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-choosing-mechanic-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not every repair shop is equipped to handle today's commercial diesel technology. Emissions systems, DEF components, and diagnostic software require specialized training and equipment. When searching for commercial truck service near me, it's important to choose a dealership that understands both the technical side of repairs and the realities of running a trucking business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-moving",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Your Fleet Moving With Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-moving"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-moving-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Running out of diesel exhaust fluid can lead to reduced performance, emissions system problems, and costly downtime. The good news is that most DEF-related issues are preventable with proper maintenance and quick attention to warning signs. From preventative maintenance to complete diesel exhaust system repair, our service department is equipped to support owner-operators and commercial fleets throughout Florida. Schedule your service appointment today and keep your trucks moving forward with confidence.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
